  "N14" [label="(7,2,0) Currently, achieving dense labeling in fixed tissues has remained challenging."];
  "N15" [label="(8,1,0) If uniform and continuous membrane labeling is enabled, ultrastructure is preserved alongside visualization of associated proteins."];
